{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "PRO",
  "chapter": 11,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.11.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A false balance is an abomination to Jehovah;\nBut a just weight is his delight.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.11.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When pride cometh, then cometh shame;\nBut with the lowly is wisdom.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.11.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The integrity of the upright shall guide them;\nBut the perverseness of the treacherous shall destroy them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.11.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Riches profit not in the day of wrath;\nBut righteousness delivereth from death.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.11.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The righteousness of the perfect shall direct his way;\nBut the wicked shall fall by his own wickedness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.11.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The righteousness of the upright shall deliver them;\nBut the treacherous shall be taken in their own iniquity.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.11.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When a wicked man dieth, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " expectation shall perish;\nAnd the hope of iniquity perisheth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.11.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The righteous is delivered out of trouble;\nAnd the wicked cometh in his stead.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.11.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "With his mouth the godless man destroyeth his neighbor;\nBut through knowledge shall the righteous be delivered.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.11.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When it goeth well with the righteous, the city rejoiceth;\nAnd when the wicked perish, there is shouting.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.11.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "By the blessing of the upright the city is exalted;\nBut it is overthrown by the mouth of the wicked.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.11.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that despiseth his neighbor is void of wisdom;\nBut a man of understanding holdeth his peace.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.11.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that goeth about as a tale-bearer revealeth secrets;\nBut he that is of a faithful spirit concealeth a matter.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.11.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Where no wise guidance is, the people falleth;\nBut in the multitude of counsellors there is safety.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.11.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that is surety for a stranger shall smart for it;\nBut he that hateth suretyship is secure.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.11.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A gracious woman obtaineth honor;\nAnd violent men obtain riches.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.11.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The merciful man doeth good to his own soul;\nBut he that is cruel troubleth his own flesh.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.11.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The wicked earneth deceitful wages;\nBut he that soweth righteousness ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "hath",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a sure reward.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.11.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that is stedfast in righteousness ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall attain",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " unto life;\nAnd he that pursueth evil ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "doeth it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to his own death.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.11.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They that are perverse in heart are an abomination to Jehovah;\nBut such as are perfect in ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "their",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " way are his delight.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.11.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Though",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " hand ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "join",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in hand, the evil man shall not be unpunished;\nBut the seed of the righteous shall be delivered.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.11.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a ring of gold in a swine’s snout,",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "So is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a fair woman that is without discretion.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.11.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The desire of the righteous is only good;",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "But",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the expectation of the wicked is wrath.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.11.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "There is that scattereth, and increaseth yet more;\nAnd there is that withholdeth more than is meet, but ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it tendeth",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " only to want.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.11.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The liberal soul shall be made fat;\nAnd he that watereth shall be watered also himself.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.11.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that withholdeth grain, the people shall curse him;\nBut blessing shall be upon the head of him that selleth it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.11.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that diligently seeketh good seeketh favor;\nBut he that searcheth after evil, it shall come unto him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.11.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that trusteth in his riches shall fall;\nBut the righteous shall flourish as the green leaf.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.11.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that troubleth his own house shall inherit the wind;\nAnd the foolish shall be servant to the wise of heart.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.11.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The fruit of the righteous is a tree of life;\nAnd he that is wise winneth souls.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.11.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Behold, the righteous shall be recompensed in the earth;\nHow much more the wicked and the sinner!",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ]
}
